adaptation-samsung-beyond2lte (16) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The One UI QML overlays (FormCard, the Kirigami page header, the Breeze
    toolbar) are no longer copies of the edited files: qml-oneui.diff is
    applied at build time to the files of the archive packages, and -tools
    depends on exactly those versions.  The archive moved on (FormCard 1.14,
    Kirigami 6.30), and files edited for 1.12 and 6.28 must not be mixed into
    the newer modules.  The diff is ported to those versions: FormCard 1.14
    moved the card background to private/FormCardBackground.qml, and its
    FormDelegateBackground already takes the corner radius from the card, so
    that file is no longer replaced (postinst drops the old diversion).
  * The modem signal range moves to /etc/ofono/binder.d/90-s10plus.conf,
    which ofono merges over binder.conf.  Diverting the binder.conf conffile
    of ofono-configs-binder-common made dpkg stop on a conffile prompt
    ("Deleted locally since installation"), which hangs an image build;
    postinst drops the old diversion and the original file comes back.
  * plasma-settings and plasma-workspace accept any rebuild of the same
    release (26.04.0-1+b1 is in the archive now, 26.04.0-1 is gone).

